      "value": "With the help of a friend, I figured out how to re-enable these settings.\n\n1. Open up Regedit\n\n2. Go to Computer\\HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\SOFTWARE\\VRChat\\VRChat\n\n3. Look for:\n\n- VRC_HUD_SMOOTHING_Desktop_h2589019796\n\n- VRC_USE_OUTLINE_MIC_ICON_h3135516813\n\n4. Double click, set the hexadecimal value to 1\n\nI really am praying these features come back to the settings menu as I don't understand why they were removed :(",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
